# Enter at the end of a block with visible children adds its first child; on a collapsed one it adds a sibling after it.
file <<END
Meeting notes:
	- Agenda
	Attendees
Next:
END
see Agenda
keys <Enter> <Enter>
type Decisions
keys <Esc> k ' <Enter> <Enter>
type After
keys <Esc>
see After
quit
saved <<END
Meeting notes:
	- Decisions
	- Agenda
	Attendees
After
Next:
END
